# Mail link (specs/005-mail-link): on the link screen the link is handed to the mail app after a confirmation that defaults to Cancel. The host has no mail app:
# a stand-in answers the hand-off (handoff 0 = passed on, handoff 1 = not accepted). Run after 19-share-limits.walk with the same server, so the rules that walk set
# (a password and an expiry date forced, upload off) are switched off again here.
# server share-rules password off
# server share-rules expiry off
# server share-rules upload on
size 1404 1872
handoff 0
waitfor homeState Connected to Example Cloud
tap homeFiles
waitfor folderRow
tap folderUp
wait 400
tap folderUp
wait 400
waitfor folderRow
# a link to mail: select Books, open Share, create a read-only link with the defaults; the list shows the user, group and other shares first, then the public links (row 4 is a link of the user)
tap folderSelect
wait 300
tap folderRow 1
wait 300
tap folderShare
waitfor shareRow
tap shareCreate
waitfor shareFormCreate
tap shareFormCreate
waitfor dialogText read this folder
tap footerButton 1
wait 1200
waitfor shareRow
# US1: the link screen has the tool; the confirmation says where the link goes and defaults to Cancel
tap shareRow 4
waitfor shareLinkText
expect shareLinkText https://
tap shareLinkMail
waitfor dialogText PB Office
shot @OUT@/200-mail-confirm.png
expect dialogText new mail draft
expect dialogText Drafts
# Cancel: nothing is handed over, the link screen is as it was
tap footerButton 0
wait 400
expect_absent dialogText
expect shareLinkText https://
# confirm: the stand-in passes it on, the link screen is gone and the list is shown (two taps from the link screen in all, SC-001)
taps_reset
tap shareLinkMail
waitfor dialogText PB Office
tap footerButton 1
wait 800
expect_taps_max 2
expect_absent shareLinkText
waitfor shareRow
shot @OUT@/201-mail-handed-over.png
# US2: the stand-in does not accept it (a running mail app answers 1): the link screen says so, shows no second try and keeps the link for a deliberate repeat
handoff 1
tap shareRow 4
waitfor shareLinkText
tap shareLinkMail
waitfor dialogText PB Office
tap footerButton 1
wait 800
waitfor shareLinkMailMessage could not take the link
shot @OUT@/202-mail-not-accepted.png
expect shareLinkMailMessage Close PB Office and try again
expect shareLinkMailMessage not installed
# Back leaves the link screen and drops the notice; nothing is shown again
tap shareLinkBack
wait 500
expect_absent shareLinkText
expect_absent shareLinkMailMessage
handoff 0
tap shareBack
wait 400
tap folderSelectDone
wait 300
